          "title": "From faint knock to seized engine - and the dealer quote that changed everything.",
          "description": "The dealer performed a preliminary inspection. The oil was drained and found to contain visible metallic particles - silver and copper glitter consistent with bearing material. A borescope inspection through the oil filler cap confirmed the bottom end had failed.",
