              "height": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dealer diagnosis"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "\"Complete bottom-end failure requiring a full engine replacement. £12,000 for a new crate engine. We only fit new VW parts.\""
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Specialist second opinion"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "\"A reconditioned unit with 12-month warranty for less than half the price. Why not-\""
