          "description": "The vehicle was worth approximately £8,000-£12,000 before failure [THIRD-PARTY - Auto Trader, March 2025]. A dealer engine at £12,000 would mean spending more than the vehicle's value. A reconditioned engine at £5,500 represented approximately 45-70% of the vehicle's value - expensive but viable for a well-maintained example.",
