              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "£5,500 fitted. Fully rebuilt with 12-month warranty. Balance of cost and reliability."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The dealer wanted £12,000 for a new engine"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Why"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The specialist did a reconditioned unit for £5,500. The owner asked: \"Why would anyone go to a dealer for a 10-year-old vehicle-\""
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "£8,000-£12,000"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Vehicle value"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "£12,000 dealer engine would exceed vehicle value - uneconomical."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dealer vs specialist"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Price difference"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Dealer refused to fit anything other than new. Specialist offered reconditioned with 12-month warranty for less than half the price."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "2-3 years"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ownership plan"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Owner planned to keep the truck - 12-month warranty provided adequate peace of mind."
            },
            {
